If you call `is_duplicated` on *student_grades*, the output may not look very useful at first.

::: {#75f718fe .cell execution_count=15}
``` {.python .cell-code}
student_grades.is_duplicated()
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=15}
